-- Career module PR 3b (spec 2026-10-22 cv-tailoring §5–6): batches of 1–20 job links, one posting per
-- distinct normalized link, and the CV tailored to each posting. Additive only: three new tables, three
-- new enum types, plus a `(id, user_id)` unique index on `cv_bases` as the target of the composite owner FKs: a
-- batch, posting or tailored CV can never point at another owner's CV base or batch. Every row cascades from
-- the owner, and from the CV base through the batch (spec §6).

